Adaptation 02-principle-consolidation

The 24 principle-* skills and the always-on unslop skill are retired. Their guidance lives in four
conditional references, poteto-mode/references/engineering-{design,evolution,verification,coordination}.md,
which the other skills link to; poteto-mode routes by task instead of mandating panels for routine work.
Upstream's later edits to nine principles are folded into those references.

Fork source: https://github.com/mneves75/pstack-claude commits 296c78d, d13480d (link repairs), 3017177, merge repairs in 628d30d and c8a00d6.
Applies to the port's plugins/pstack/skills tree after the patches numbered before it.

